me>FURUTA YOUSUKE</last-name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>EGAWA, HIROYUKI</last-name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>FURUTA, YOUSUKE</last-name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Nitrogenous heterocyclic carboxamide derivatives represented by general formula (I), or salts thereof are useful as preventives and therapeutic agents for infections with viruses, particularly influenza virus. In said formula A is an optionally substituted pyrazine, pyrimidine, pyridazine or triazine ring; R&lt;1&gt; is O or OH; R&lt;2&gt; is hydrogen, acyl, or optionally substituted carbamoylalkyl or carboxyalkyl; and the broken line represents a single or double bond.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne des dérivés hétérocycliques azotés de carboxamide représentés par la formule générale (I) ou certains de leurs sels, lesquels dérivés et sels conviennent comme agents préventifs et thérapeutiques pour les infections à virus, et notamment le virus de la grippe. En l'occurrence, A est un cycle pyrazine, pyrimidine, pyridazine ou triazine éventuellement modifié. R&lt;1&gt; est O ou OH; R&lt;2&gt; est hydrogène, acyle, carbamoylalkyle ou carboxyalkyle éventuellement substitué. La ligne tiretée représente une liaison simple ou double.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.or